==5号线==
{{main|深圳地铁5号线}}
*[[深圳地铁5号线|5号线]]为半环形线路，主要途经近原[[深圳经济特区#管制措施|二线关]]的关内外地区和前海自贸区<ref name=":0">{{Cite web|title=地铁环中线开张 深圳北站迎客|url=http://news.sina.com.cn/o/2011-06-22/080922684271.shtml|access-date=2021-09-06|author=任笑|date=2011-06-22|work=[[南方都市报]]|archive-date=2021-09-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210906155920/http://news.sina.com.cn/o/2011-06-22/080922684271.shtml|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=深圳地铁5号线全线开通|url=http://www.gov.cn/jrzg/2011-06/23/content_1891071.htm|access-date=2021-09-07|author=杨小文|date=2011-06-23|work=[[新华社]]|archive-date=2021-09-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210907170330/http://www.gov.cn/jrzg/2011-06/23/content_1891071.htm|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=约起！深圳地铁5号线二期9月28日开通|url=https://www.sznews.com/news/content/2019-09/17/content_22475609.htm|access-date=2021-09-07|author=涂胜|date=2019-09-17|work=深圳新闻网|archive-date=2021-03-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210308223444/https://www.sznews.com/news/content/2019-09/17/content_22475609.htm|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=深圳地铁5号线二期工程通车|url=https://news.cctv.com/2019/09/28/ARTIkLaQVYwzvwfXDKNLVsQc190928.shtml|access-date=2021-09-07|author=赛欣言|date=2019-09-28|last=|work=[[央视网]]|archive-date=2020-09-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200924045132/http://news.cctv.com/2019/09/28/ARTIkLaQVYwzvwfXDKNLVsQc190928.shtml|dead-url=no}}</ref>。
