==7号线==
{{main|深圳地铁7号线}}
[[深圳地铁7号线|7号线]]是联系原特区内主要居住区与就业区的局域线，线路东西向横穿深圳市区，线路布局呈“V”形<ref>{{Cite web|title=深圳地铁7号线今日通车 比原计划提前两月|url=http://news.cctv.com/2016/10/28/ARTImZZsiLjkbNY3ZVjafnP0161028.shtml|access-date=2021-09-07|author=李文亮|date=2016-10-28|work=[[央视网]]|archive-date=2021-09-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210907175654/http://news.cctv.com/2016/10/28/ARTImZZsiLjkbNY3ZVjafnP0161028.shtml|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name=":11">{{Cite web|title=深圳地铁7、9号线开通试运营|url=http://www.chinanews.com/sh/2016/10-28/8046353.shtml|access-date=2021-09-07|author=郑小红|date=2016-10-28|coauthors=陈文|work=[[中新社]]|archive-date=2021-02-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210203013247/http://www.chinanews.com/sh/2016/10-28/8046353.shtml|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name=":12">{{Cite web|title=深圳地铁7、9号线开通，皇岗、文锦渡口岸可直达|url=http://ka.sz.gov.cn/ztzl/24htg/sjdt/content/post_2288218.html|access-date=2021-09-07|date=2016-10-28|work=[[深圳市人民政府]]口岸办公室|archive-date=2021-09-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210907170333/http://ka.sz.gov.cn/ztzl/24htg/sjdt/content/post_2288218.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>。
